    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/2f2b6f68211a43279403f5f74bad6353.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.poster.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.webm?t=1754148004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.mp4?t=1754148004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Demonborg Mining Co it's your job to pilot a drill drone through the insides of giant demon cyborgs while mining precious metals! Install and upgrade auto-firing turrets to protect you from defense bots and help you mine your way through the ever changing Demonborgs. Install dozens of perks and engage with text based events for rewards and punishments. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs. No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/5a4f11a52f3cd4874ab688ce77a1e5cd.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make quick decisions as your drill drone perpetually descends through the procedually generated Demonborgs. Mining bricks for materials, destroying Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper and investigating points of interest   that may help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/44030428c15acaefaedf2144a4c465f1.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mined brick materials and copper from defeated Demonborg defense bots to upgrade your auto-firing turrets. Equip gameplay changing perks for an edge in-game and in text events. Build new turrets and maintain your drill drone between mission. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/07b4259bdd9faba14450c6e40eca1021.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate points of interest to engage in encounters that may unlock new perks or turrets, grant you bonus materials and more. Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/2f2b6f68211a43279403f5f74bad6353.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.poster.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.webm?t=1754148004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.mp4?t=1754148004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Demonborg Mining Co it's your job to pilot a drill drone through the insides of giant demon cyborgs while mining precious metals! Install and upgrade auto-firing turrets to protect you from defense bots and help you mine your way through the ever changing Demonborgs. Install dozens of perks and engage with text based events for rewards and punishments. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs. No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/5a4f11a52f3cd4874ab688ce77a1e5cd.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make quick decisions as your drill drone perpetually descends through the procedually generated Demonborgs. Mining bricks for materials, destroying Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper and investigating points of interest   that may help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/44030428c15acaefaedf2144a4c465f1.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mined brick materials and copper from defeated Demonborg defense bots to upgrade your auto-firing turrets. Equip gameplay changing perks for an edge in-game and in text events. Build new turrets and maintain your drill drone between mission. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/07b4259bdd9faba14450c6e40eca1021.avif?t=1754148004\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate points of interest to engage in encounters that may unlock new perks or turrets, grant you bonus materials and more. Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Demonborg Mining Co is a unique rogue-lite about mining the insides of giant demon cyborgs with your auto-firing turret loaded drill drone.",
